# Panes - colab (actions/colab/colab_panes.kbd)
**panes + h**        -- Prev Cell (C-m [up])
**panes + l**        -- Next Cell (C-m [down])
**panes + up**       -- Prev Cell (C-m [up])
**panes + j**        -- Next Cell (C-m [down])
**panes + move + h** -- Move Cell Up (C-m k)
**panes + move + l** -- Move Cell Down (C-m j)
**panes + move + k** -- Move Cell Up (C-m k)
**panes + move + j** -- Move Cell Down (C-m j)
